Hi! I am a humble Maid!{VAR BE01}
My master has a big heart to match his
big belly. He's a gourmet!{VAR BE01}
So I am looking for ingredients that will
make his heart jump for joy!{VAR BE01}

Sniff, sniff... Sniff, sniff...{VAR BE01}
Oh, that aroma! It smells so gourmet!{VAR BE01}
Do you have a wonderful ingredient in
your Bag?{VAR BE00}
Would you consider selling it to me?{VAR BE01}

Oh, it smells so good!{VAR BE01}
That {VAR 0109 0000} of yours is a very
rare ingredient indeed!{VAR BE01}
Would you take ${VAR 0207 0001} for it?

Merci! Thank you!!{VAR BE01}
With this, I can create a superb menu.
My master will be so surprised!

Aww... Well, that's OK.{VAR BE01}
If you find a gourmet ingredient for me,
please let me know!

Sniff, sniff... Sniff, sniff...{VAR BE01}
Well, I don't smell anything interesting
in your Bag.{VAR BE01}
But if you find a gourmet ingredient,
please let me know!

Ore, ore, ore...
Ores that I adore!{VAR BE01}
Ah, this is where you should laugh...{VAR BE01}
Anyway... I will pay you well for
rare ores.{VAR BE01}
And not just ores! Stones, gems,
shards...anything mineral! I love it all!{VAR BE01}

Oh, I do adore the ores!{VAR BE01}
That {VAR 0109 0000}, it's shaking me!
Will you sell it for ${VAR 0207 0001}?

Huh? What on earth is this?{VAR BE01}
You can't shake my core
with an ore so poor!

As you can see,
I am an ultrarich billionaire!{VAR BE01}
And as you can see,
my hobby is to collect rare items!{VAR BE01}
In fact, this outfit is ultra expensive
and rare.{VAR BE00}
Can you see it? Can you?{VAR BE01}

There's something that this billionaire
wants to get his hands on, even if it{VAR BE00}
means spending a lot of money.{VAR BE01}
Do you have such a rare item?
Do you?{VAR BE01}

Actually, it's...
It's a rare treasure, Relic Crown!{VAR BE01}
I was told it was at the innermost part
of the Abyssal Ruins!{VAR BE01}
I think it is understandable that you
want to treasure it, but will you sell it{VAR BE00}
to me for ${VAR 0207 0001}? Will you?

There's something that this billionaire
wants to get his hands on, even if it{VAR BE00}
means spending a lot of money.{VAR BE01}
Do you have such a rare item?
Do you?{VAR BE01}
Grrr! You don't have a rare item,
do you?

Hey, check it out. I've got a sweet deal
for ya!{VAR BE01}
You know how Pokémon like to hide behind
stones or rocks, yeah?{VAR BE01}
Sometimes they hide cool stuff, too.{VAR BE01}
If you find something cool behind a rock,
you should bring it to me.{VAR BE01}
I'll make it worth your while.{VAR BE01}

Hey, thanks!{VAR BE01}
I bet I can sell this to a collector for
way more than I just gave you.{VAR BE01}
Ha! That's business for ya!

Hey, come see me if you find something
cool, got it?{VAR BE01}
I'll make it worth your while.
